DESCRIPTION:<p>Stay Connected!</p><p>If there is anything about SAP HANA you always wanted to know but never dared to ask - this is the place for you! Be part of the community of development experts, users and partners to exchange, ignite and delight.</p><p>Get Involved! If you want to speak up in your own session worthwhile to be shared with this great community. Looking forward to see you there soon!</p><p>This year's event will take place in St. Leon-Rot (Germany) on July 16, 2026. Ticket reservation is not open yet. Follow us on social media to stay up-to-date!</p><p><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" class="text-blue-600 underline" href="https://hanatech.community">https://hanatech.community</a></p><p><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" class="text-blue-600 underline" href="https://bsky.app/profile/hanatech.community">https://bsky.app/profile/hanatech.community</a></p><p><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" class="text-blue-600 underline" href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/hana-tech-con/posts/">https://www.linkedin.com/company/hana-tech-con/posts/</a></p>
